WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.771
Welcome to Standings War, Mat.

2
00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.427
It opens on one number,

3
00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:08.647
the wins Phoenix needs to reach 6th-seed pace.

4
00:00:08.647 --> 00:00:10.577
As of Monday night, that was 43,

5
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.613
with 69 games left.

6
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.220
Under it are three lines,

7
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.700
for the 6th, 8th and 10th seeds.

8
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.740
Each is the win rate Phoenix needs from here,

9
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.178
not a forecast.

10
00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:22.947
Every section has a Phoenix lens,

11
00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:25.347
a short note on what it means for the Suns.

12
00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:27.153
Tap the star beside any team

13
00:00:27.153 --> 00:00:28.323
and it is saved to your Favorites,

14
00:00:28.323 --> 00:00:29.267
on your phone.

15
00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.787
The Rooting Guide covers every game from Monday night,

16
00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:34.058
and the result that helps Phoenix.

17
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.647
The scoreboard for the night before

18
00:00:35.647 --> 00:00:39.190
marks each final Helped, Hurt, or No stake.

19
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.920
Longer lists stay folded

20
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.409
until you tap to open them.

21
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.420
Pick Watch follows the three 2027 firsts

22
00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.580
in Phoenix's pick race,

23
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.730
and opens to the full draft order,

24
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:51.039
all 30 teams.

25
00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:53.053
To keep it on your home screen,

26
00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.133
open it in Safari, tap Share,

27
00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:56.689
then Add to Home Screen.

28
00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.080
That's Standings War.

29
00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.898
It was built for you, Mat.
